cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: praktika_osm
abstract: >-
  Praktika: on-premises meeting minutes with evidence citations and human approval.
  Draft minutes cite the transcript segment behind every decision, action, open question and
  risk; a deterministic verifier checks those citations and the numbers and names in the
  minutes, and a named reviewer approves them before export.
authors:
  - given-names: Stratos
    family-names: Samaras
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-02"
repository-code: "https://github.com/egsamaras/praktika_osm"
keywords:
  - meeting minutes
  - speech-to-text
  - on-premises
  - large language models
  - human in the loop
  - privacy
